    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Revisiting Text Ranking in Deep Research
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Meng%2C+C">Chuan Meng</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ou%2C+L">Litu Ou</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=MacAvaney%2C+S">Sean MacAvaney</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Dalton%2C+J">Jeff Dalton</a>
      
