        Agentic AI for Intent-driven Optimization in Cell-free O-RAN
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Shokouhi%2C+M+H">Mohammad Hossein Shokouhi</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wong%2C+V+W+S">Vincent W. S. Wong</a>
      
