    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Interface Framework for Human-AI Collaboration within Intelligent User Interface Ecosystems
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Andru%2C+S">Shruthi Andru</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Saksena%2C+S+K">Shrut Kirti Saksena</a>
      
