        Language Models Exhibit Inconsistent Biases Towards Algorithmic Agents and Human Experts
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Bo%2C+J+Y">Jessica Y. Bo</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Mok%2C+L">Lillio Mok</a>, 
      
