        AgentLTV: An Agent-Based Unified Search-and-Evolution Framework for Automated Lifetime Value Prediction
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wu%2C+C">Chaowei Wu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Chen%2C+H">Huazhu Chen</a>, 
      
