        An Agentic System for Schema Aware NL2SQL Generation
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Onyango%2C+D">David Onyango</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Mansoor%2C+N">Naseef Mansoor</a>
      
