        <span>&nbsp;[<a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2603.10028">pdf</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/ps/2603.10028">ps</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/format/2603.10028">other</a>]&nbsp;</span>
