        AnimeAgent: Is the Multi-Agent via Image-to-Video models a Good Disney Storytelling Artist?
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Yan%2C+H">Hailong Yan</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Liu%2C+S">Shice Liu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wang%2C+T">Tao Wang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhang%2C+X">Xiangtao Zhang</a>, 
      
